{"ID":"20240802124244-5zpyd1c","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240802124244-5zpyd1c","title":"银柴胡 （山苜楂、山麻楂、霞草）","type":"doc","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240802124300-rsrfoyj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240802124300-rsrfoyj","updated":"20240802124300"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产甘肃、宁夏、陕西、内蒙古等地。\n【性状】\t呈类圆柱形，偶有分枝，长1540cm，直径0.52.5cm。表面浅棕黄色至浅棕色，有扭曲的纵皱纹及支根痕，多具孔穴状或盘状凹陷，从砂眼处折断可见棕色裂隙中有细砂散出，根头部略膨大，有密集的呈疣状突起的芽苞、茎或根茎的残基。质硬而脆，易折断，断面不平坦，较疏松，有裂隙，皮部甚薄，木部有黄、白色相间的放射状纹理。气微，味甘。栽培品有分枝，下部多扭曲，直径0.3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.2cm。表面浅棕黄色或浅黄棕色，纵皱纹细腻明显，细支根痕多呈点状凹陷。根头部有多数疣状突起。几无砂眼。折断面质地较紧密，几无裂隙，略显粉性，木部放射状纹理不甚明显。味微甜。\n【性味】\t甘，微寒。\n【功效】\t清热凉血。治虚劳骨蒸，阴虚久疟，小儿瘠热羸瘦。\n【注解】\t“珍珠盘”：指药材根头部由多数残留茎基及芽密集而成的疣状突起，形似镶嵌的珍珠盘。\n“沙眼”：指药材表面具有的多数圆形孔状凹陷的须根痕点。"}]},{"ID":"20240802124300-ucym1y9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240802124300-ucym1y9","updated":"20240802124300"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206093300-evpvns3.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240802124403-pcwp5bb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240802124403-pcwp5bb","updated":"20240802124403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 597px;","style":"width: 587px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"银柴胡 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/银柴胡 11-20240802124403-h5ksn9z.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 587px;\" parent-style=\"width: 597px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240802124300-mvrrfo5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240802124300-mvrrfo5","updated":"20240802124300"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"银柴胡"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/银柴胡-20240205160251-x2q58nv.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240802124300-tkr3zmn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240802124300-tkr3zmn","updated":"20240802124300"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240618132815-y2onbwv.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240802124300-acqz008","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240802124300-acqz008","updated":"20240802124300"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 417px;","style":"width: 407px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"银柴胡 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/银柴胡 2-20240802114800-w60szhy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 407px;\" parent-style=\"width: 417px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 856px;","style":"width: 846px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"银柴胡 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/银柴胡 3-20240802115401-ub9jow8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 846px;\" parent-style=\"width: 856px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240802124300-gr1y8va","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240802124300-gr1y8va","updated":"20240802124304"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 544px;","style":"width: 534px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"银柴胡 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/银柴胡 8-20240802123543-3dbwb81.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 534px;\" parent-style=\"width: 544px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 703px;","style":"width: 693px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"银柴胡 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/银柴胡 9-20240802124114-ed8i7jn.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 693px;\" parent-style=\"width: 703px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240802124300-5nyzqf3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240802124300-5nyzqf3","updated":"20240802124300"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 519px;","style":"width: 509px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"银柴胡 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/银柴胡 5-20240802115608-w9u8b0s.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 509px;\" parent-style=\"width: 519px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 689px;","style":"width: 679px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"银柴胡 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/银柴胡 6-20240802115642-0bch4n6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 679px;\" parent-style=\"width: 689px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240802124300-ok17nl6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240802124300-ok17nl6","updated":"20240802124300"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 864px;","style":"width: 854px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"银柴胡 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/银柴胡 7-20240802115906-xmmfhle.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 854px;\" parent-style=\"width: 864px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 358px;","style":"width: 348px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"银柴胡 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/银柴胡 4-20240802115438-w0uan81.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 348px;\" parent-style=\"width: 358px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240802124655-ztjtfw4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240802124655-ztjtfw4","updated":"20240802124655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 352px;","style":"width: 342px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"银柴胡 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/银柴胡 10-20240802124200-1uiaxo0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 342px;\" parent-style=\"width: 352px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 821px;","style":"width: 811px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240802113119-syyccg3.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 811px;\" parent-style=\"width: 821px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240802124659-fan3p3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240802124659-fan3p3p","updated":"20240802124709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：为山苜楂的根；"}]},{"ID":"20240802124930-yzuhvst","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240802124930-yzuhvst","updated":"20240802125012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"二注：银柴胡与柴胡名字相近，功效并不同；点我跳转→"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240205153920-er4y3zy","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"031茈胡（柴胡）"}]},{"ID":"20240802124244-ew2t45g","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240802124244-ew2t45g"}},{"ID":"20240902180006-48lkbmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-48lkbmm","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：银柴胡"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-lzx2m4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-lzx2m4v","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"银柴胡《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-gl8a5s7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-gl8a5s7","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】YínCháiHú"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-pqi7pro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-pqi7pro","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】RADIXSTELLARIAE"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-6drx71t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-6drx71t","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为石竹科繁缕属植物银柴胡StellariadichotomaL.var.lanceolataBge.的干燥根。春、夏间植株萌发或秋后茎叶枯萎时采挖；栽培品于种植后第三年9月中旬或第四年4月中旬采挖，除去残茎、须根及泥沙，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-h5u0orf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-h5u0orf","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-tvzfrm4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-tvzfrm4","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品呈类圆柱形，偶有分枝，长15～40cm，直径0.5～2.5cm。表面淡棕黄色或浅棕色，有扭曲的纵皱纹及支根痕，多具孔穴状或盘状凹陷，习称“砂眼”，从砂眼处折断可见棕色裂隙中有细砂散出。根头部略膨大，有密集的呈疣状突起的芽苞、茎或根茎的残基，习称“珍珠盘”。质硬而脆，易折断，断面不平坦，较疏松，有裂隙，皮部甚薄，木部有黄、白色相间的放射状纹理。气微，味甘。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-knufvij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-knufvij","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培品有分枝，下部多扭曲，直径0.6～1.2cm。表面浅棕黄色或浅黄棕色，纵皱纹细腻明显，细支根痕多呈点状凹陷。根头部有多数疣状突起。几无砂眼。折断面质地较紧密，几无裂隙，略显粉性，木部放射状纹理不甚明显。味微甜。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-nb1vs6t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-nb1vs6t","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-mgcc8rp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-mgcc8rp","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）本品横切面：木栓细胞数列至10余列。皮层较窄。韧皮部筛管群明显。形成层成环。木质部发达。射线宽至10余列细胞。薄壁细胞含草酸钙砂晶，以射线细胞中为多见。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-ztrz54i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-ztrz54i","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品粉末1g，加无水乙醇10ml，浸渍15分钟，滤过。取滤液2ml，置紫外光灯（365nm）下观察，显亮蓝微紫色的荧光。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-2fqy5uu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-2fqy5uu","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）取本品粉末0.1g，加甲醇25ml，超声处理10分钟，滤过，滤液置50ml量瓶中，加甲醇至刻度。照分光亮度法（附录ⅤA）测定，在270nm±2nm波长处有最大吸收。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-udihixb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-udihixb","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】除去杂质，洗净，润透，切厚片，干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-1dgkk6l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-1dgkk6l","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘，微寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-hea9jis","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-hea9jis","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肝、胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-qq9c408","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-qq9c408","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】清虚热，除疳热。用于阴虚发热，骨蒸劳热，小儿疳热。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-g8mkf1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-g8mkf1r","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】3～9g。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-vkjc755","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-vkjc755","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置通风干燥处，防蛀。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-80zo6oe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-80zo6oe","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-96eafcf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-96eafcf","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）退热而不苦泄，为清虚热的要药，常与青蒿、地骨皮等药同用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-xsyrh9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-xsyrh9i","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）《全国中草药汇编》中银柴胡原植物与《中国药典》不同。《全国中草药汇编》的记录如下。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-kbowvs0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-kbowvs0","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原植物英文名：StellariagypsophiloidesFenzl."}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-4mv7sz1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-4mv7sz1","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原植物中文名：银柴胡"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-ttk2f0z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-ttk2f0z","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"附注：有些文献以同属植物狭叶歧繁缕StellariadichotomaL.var.lanceolataBge.的根为银柴胡是鉴定上的错误。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-3qf7xqr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-3qf7xqr","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-88afv0l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-88afv0l","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"银柴胡《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-rl0vg3m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-rl0vg3m","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-dcungte","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-dcungte","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】YínCháiHú"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-beuawrm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-beuawrm","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】银胡（《本草求真》），山菜根、山马踏菜根（《山东中药》），牛肚根、沙参儿、白根子、土参（《中药志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-me5vxzt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-me5vxzt","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为石竹科植物银柴胡的根。秋季采挖，除去茎、叶及须根，洗净，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-406w4ou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-406w4ou","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】多年生草本，高20～40厘米。主根圆柱形，直径1～3厘米，外皮淡黄色，顶端有许多疣状的残茎痕迹。茎直立，节明显，上部二叉状分歧，密被短毛或腺毛。叶对生；无柄；茎下部叶较大，披针形，长4～30毫米，宽1.5～4毫米，先端锐尖，基部圆形，全缘，上面绿色，疏被短毛或几无毛，下面淡绿色，被短毛。花单生，花梗长1～4厘米；花小，白色；萼片5，绿色，披针形，外具腺毛，边缘膜质；花瓣5，较萼片为短，先端2深裂，裂片长圆形；雄蕊10，着生在花瓣的基部，稍长于花瓣；雌蕊1，子房上位，近于球形，花柱3，细长。蒴果近球形，成熟时顶端6齿裂。花期6～7月。果期8～9月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-ouhopf2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-ouhopf2","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】生长于干燥的草原、悬岩的石缝或碎石中。分布陕西、甘肃、内蒙古、宁夏等地。主产宁夏、内蒙古、陕西等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-78l8soe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-78l8soe","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】干燥的根呈圆柱形，长15～40厘米，直径1～2.5厘米。根头顶瑞有多数细小疣状突起，为地上茎痕，密集而发白，习称\"珍珠盘\"。下端略细，少数有分歧。表面黄棕或带灰棕色，有扭曲的纵纹及支根痕，并可见多数圆形小孔，习称\"沙眼\"，近根头处尤多，自此处折断，断面有棕色花纹。质松脆，折断时有粉尘飞出，断面粗糙，有空隙，中有大形黄白色相间的放射状花纹。气微，味甘、微苦。以条长、外皮淡黄棕色、断面黄白色者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-wtaat4f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-wtaat4f","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】丝石竹根含三萜皂甙，甙元是棉根皂甙元。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-3afw0oc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-3afw0oc","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】同属植物太平洋丝石竹内提取的三萜皂甙，给家兔在形成动脉粥样硬化的同时或以后每天内服，可降低血清胆甾醇浓度，使胆甾醇/脑磷脂系数降低，并使主动脉类脂质含量降低。对于动脉硬化家兔所表现的兴奋、脱毛以及肢体皮下类脂质增厚等症状均有改善。有人认为，皂甙可作用于血浆脂蛋白，阻止胆甾醇的酯化及其在血管壁的沉积，也有认为可以阻止胆甾醇从肠道吸收。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-591d67v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-591d67v","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】银柴胡：拣去杂质，去声，用水洗净，稍浸泡捞出，润透，切片，晒干。鳖血银柴胡：取银柴胡片，置大盆内，淋入用温水少许稀释的鳖血，拌匀，闷润，置锅内用文火微炒，职出，放凉。（每锒柴胡100斤，用活鳖200个取血）"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-304gw2l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-304gw2l","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-d2ekgih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-d2ekgih","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘苦，凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-d40fe1j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-d40fe1j","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经逢原》：\"甘，微寒，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-dez4l67","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-dez4l67","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《医林纂要》：\"苦，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-y2bopwh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-y2bopwh","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《陕西中草药》：\"味甘微苦。性凉。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-3qh31xc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-3qh31xc","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-vqbd12i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-vqbd12i","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入肝、胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-m1phz6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-m1phz6b","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经逢原》：\"行足阳明、少阴。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-95bqf69","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-95bqf69","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草便读》：\"入肝、胆。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-z5jglzb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-z5jglzb","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-s2ec5oa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-s2ec5oa","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"清热凉血。治虚劳骨蒸，阴虚久疟，小儿疳热羸瘦。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-pucxzpv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-pucxzpv","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经疏》：\"治劳热骨蒸。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-9n64ujr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-9n64ujr","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草备要》：\"治劳疳良。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-sn0mktt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-sn0mktt","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草从新》：\"治虚劳肌热骨蒸，劳疟热从髓出，小儿五疳羸热。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-57kcosd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-57kcosd","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《医林纂要》：\"坚肾水，平相火。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-niwm3so","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-niwm3so","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草求原》：\"清肺、胃、脾、肾热，兼能凉血。治五脏虚损，肌肤劳热，骨蒸烦痛，湿痹拘挛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-iqeb116","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-iqeb116","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《新疆中草药手册》：\"清热凉血。治肺结核潮热。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-i6i9e11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-i6i9e11","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，1～3钱；或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-6yya259","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-6yya259","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】外感风寒及血虚无热者忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-53nvoez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-53nvoez","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-8gexiz2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-8gexiz2","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治骨蒸劳热：银柴胡一钱五分，胡黄连、秦艽、鳖甲（醋炙）、地骨皮、青蒿、知母各一钱，甘草五分。水二钟，煎八分，食远服。（《证治准绳》清骨散）"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-jv9jm87","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-jv9jm87","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治温证潮热，身体枯皮，皮肤甲错，消索而不润泽者：银柴胡二钱，鳖甲三钱。（《温症指归》银甲散）"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-ecu49vh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-ecu49vh","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-6z2k5kf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-6z2k5kf","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经逢原》：\"银柴胡，其性味与石斛不甚相远。不独清热，兼能凉血。《和剂局方》治上下诸血龙脑鸡苏丸中用之。凡人虚劳方中，惟银州者为宜，若用北柴胡，升动虚阳，发热喘嗽，愈无宁宇，可不辨而混用乎！按柴胡条下，《本经》推陈致新，明目益精，皆指银夏者而言。非北柴胡所能也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-2bix66z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-2bix66z","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草便读》：\"银柴胡，无解表之性。从来注《本草》者，皆言其能治小儿疳热，大人痨热，大抵有入肝胆凉血之功。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-ccahvsh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-ccahvsh","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草正义》：\"柴胡，古以银州产者为胜，宋之苏颂已有是说，陈承亦谓银夏者最良，然虽有其说，而尚未分用，故濒湖《纲目》仍未显为区别。今之二种分用者，盖即石顽提倡之力。而以今之功用言之，治虚热骨蒸，自有实效，断非北柴胡之升阳泄汗可比；然则古人谓柴胡为虚劳之药者，亦指银柴胡言之也。赵恕轩《纲目拾遗》，谓热在骨髓，非银柴胡莫疗，用以治虚劳肌热骨蒸，劳疟热从髓出及小儿五疳羸热，盖退热而不苦泄，理阴而不升辟，固虚热之良药。苟劳怯而未至血液枯绝，以此清理虚火之燔灼，再合之育阴补脾，尚可徐图挽救，非北柴胡之发泄者所可同日语也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-gwcaace","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-gwcaace","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-1kxuq2v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-1kxuq2v","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"除上述正品外，尚有多种石竹科植物的根部，亦作银柴胡入药，统称山银柴胡，品质较次。主要的有以下几种："}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-1yzx632","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-1yzx632","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①丝石竹（又名：霞草、欧石头花、山蚂蚱）的根，呈略扁的长圆锥形，扭曲不直，长10～22厘米，直径0.7～4.5厘米。根头部常有分叉，有多数小形突起的茎痕。外皮大半已除去，未去净处，具棕白相间的花纹。质坚体重，不易折断，断面不平坦，有多数黄白色花纹交互排列成近似环状，一般为2～4层。气弱，味苦、麻舌，并有刺激性。产于山东、山西等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-993q40f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-993q40f","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②锥花丝石竹（又名：线形瞿麦、圆叶丝石竹）的根，呈圆柱形，外皮淡黄色，顶端有多数残茎痕迹。断面黄白色。味甘。产于山西、甘肃、新疆等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-gnkngo7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-gnkngo7","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③灯心草蚤缀的根，略呈圆锥形，粗约2～4厘米，根头部有多数地上茎残基，近根头部有细横纹。表面灰棕色或淡棕色，栓皮剥落处呈黄色斑痕。断面黄白色，射线较窄。味苦。产于内蒙古、辽宁、黑龙江、河北等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-yhrbic1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-yhrbic1","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④旱麦瓶草的根，呈圆柱状，粗约0.5～2厘米，表面黄褐色，有纵皱纹，根头有小疙瘩。断面类白色。味较淡。商品又称黄柴胡、铁柴胡。产于内蒙古、河北、山东、山西、黑龙江等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-ybj2s1n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-ybj2s1n","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤蝇子草（又名：鹤草）的根，根部有时有分枝，粗约1～2厘米，根头有时带有地上茎残基，表面浅黄色，有纵纹，仔细观察，纵纹上布有稍突起之横纹。质坚硬，断面淡黄色，较平坦。味微甘，后涩。产于甘肃、陕西等地。本品的全草江苏称为脱力草，参见\"脱力草\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-oswb8oi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-oswb8oi","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-tb1b7c3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-tb1b7c3","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"银柴胡《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-ewq2ddd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-ewq2ddd","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-ypebpxv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-ypebpxv","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出自《本草纲目》。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-2w3g15w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-2w3g15w","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《本草图经》：柴胡，以银川者为胜。二月生苗，甚香，茎青紫，叶似竹叶而稍紧，亦有似斜蒿，亦有似麦门冬而短者；七月开黄花，生丹州结青子，与他处者不类。恨赤色，似前胡而强；芦头有赤毛如鼠尾，独窠长者好。二月、八月采根暴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-1qmlx6s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-1qmlx6s","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草别说》：柴胡唯银夏者最良。根如鼠尾，长一、二尺，香味甚佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-9qqynvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-9qqynvr","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《纲目》：银川，即今延安府神木县，五原城是其废迹。所产柴胡，长尺余"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-038lrng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-038lrng","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】YínCháiHú"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-ttro03u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-ttro03u","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】银夏柴胡、银胡、牛肚根、沙参儿、白根子、土参"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-g9y9exl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-g9y9exl","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-xisunxu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-xisunxu","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为石竹科植物银柴胡的根。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-rkgvjnr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-rkgvjnr","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：StellariadichotomaL.var.lanceolataBunge[S．GypsopyiloidesFenzl]"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-37i16j1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-37i16j1","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：秋季采挖，除去茎、叶及须根，洗净，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-jbrk2l6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-jbrk2l6","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】多年生草本，高20-40cm。主根圆柱形，直径1-3cm，外皮淡黄色，根头处有许多疣状的茎部残基。茎直立而纤细，上部二叉状分枝，密被短毛或腺毛；节略膨大。单叶对生；无柄；叶片披针形，长4-30mm，宽1.5-4mm，先端锐关，基都圆形，全缘，上面疏被短毛或几无毛，下面被短毛。花单生于叶腋，直径约3mm；花梗长约2cm；萼片5，披针形，长约4mm，绿色，边缘白色膜质；花瓣5，较导片为短，白色，先端2深裂；雄蕊10，2轮，花丝基部合生，黄色；子房上位，花柱3，细长。蒴果近球形，外被宿萼，成熟时先端6齿裂。种子通常1粒，椭圆形，深棕色，种皮有多数小突起。花期6-7月，果期8-9月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-zy7k83g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-zy7k83g","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-09am3b4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-09am3b4","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于干燥草原及山坡石缝中。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-91gc4ac","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-91gc4ac","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于东北及内蒙古、河北、陕西、甘肃、宁夏等地。近年来宁夏的陶乐、平罗、固原、西吉、隆德、彭阳等县试行栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-s8ntkj9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-s8ntkj9","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-1x7wnvx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-1x7wnvx","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生物学特性喜温暖或凉爽气候，耐严寒，忌水浸。适宜砂质壤上栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-gwsw5zk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-gwsw5zk","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术用种子繁殖。春季或秋季条播或穴播，行株距33～40cm,覆土1cm，保持土壤湿润，约10d出苗，苗齐后可间苗1-2次。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-4ogam79","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-4ogam79","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田间管理生长期应中耕、除草、追肥。雨季注意排水。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-wvsjx47","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-wvsjx47","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-zdcj18i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-zdcj18i","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别根呈类圆柱形，长15-40cm，直径l-2．5cm,支根多已碎断。表面黄白色或淡黄花，纵皱纹。明显，向下渐吴向左扭曲状，疏具孔状凹陷（细根痕），习称“沙眼”。顶端根头部略膨大，密集灰棕黄色、疣状突起的茎痕及不育芽胞，习称“珍珠盘”。质硬而脆，易折断，断面有裂隙；皮部甚薄，木部有黄、白色相间的放射状纹理（射线与木质部束相间而致）。气微，味淡、略甘。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-3cw60l3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-3cw60l3","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以根条细长、表面黄白色并显光泽、顶端有“珍珠盘”。质细润者为佳。显微鉴别木栓细胞数列至10余列，扁长方形或类方形，棕黄色。皮层窄，为4-8列切向延长的薄壁细胞；韧皮部筛管群明显；形成层成环；木质部以达，导管略作放射状排列，木射线宽至10余列细胞。薄壁细胞含草酸钙砂晶，尤以射线细胞中为多，尚可见草酸钙簇晶及细小油滴状物。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-c4w3xwm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-c4w3xwm","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉末特征：黄白色。①草酸钙砂晶极多，散在或充塞了薄壁细胞中；晶体呈三角形、类方形、箭头形、楔形、菱形或不规（根）外则形，直径2-9（-18）μm。②草酸钙簇晶较多，散在或与砂晶聚集于薄壁细胞中，直径9-3μm。纹和具缘纹孔导管较多，直径9-134μm。④木栓细胞淡棕黄色，壁薄，微木化。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-pp9kdrh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-pp9kdrh","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"理化鉴别取本品粉末1g。加无水乙醇10ml,浸渍15min,滤过。取滤液2ml，置紫外光灯（365nm）下观察，显亮蓝微紫色荧光。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-ghw91cp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-ghw91cp","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】银柴胡根中含有菠菜甾醇(α-spinasterol),7-豆甾烯醇（stigmast－7－enol），银柴胡环肽Ⅰ（stellariacyclopetide)Ⅰ），豆甾醇（stigmasterol）,α-菠菜甾醇-葡萄糖甙（α-spinasteryl-glucoside),7-豆甾烯醇葡萄糖甙（stigmast-7-enolglucoside）,β-谷甾醇（β-sitosterol）[1,2]。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-2en0he7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-2en0he7","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】同属植物太平洋丝石竹GypsophilapacificaKom.内提取的三萜皂甙Gypsozid，给家兔在形成动脉粥样硬化的同时或以后每天内服，可降低血清胆甾醇浓度，使胆甾醇/脑磷脂系数降低，并使主动脉类脂质含量降低。对于动脉硬化家兔所表现的兴奋。脱毛以及肢体皮下类脂质增厚等症状均有改善。有人认为，皂甙可作用于血浆脂蛋白，阻止胆甾醇的酯化及其在血管壁的沉积，也有认为可以阻止胆甾醇从肠道吸收。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-vhqyy33","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-vhqyy33","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】银柴胡：拣去杂质，去芦，用水洗净，稍浸泡捞出，润透，切片，晒干。鳖血银柴胡：取银柴胡片，置大盆内，淋人用温水少许稀释的鳖血，拌匀，闷润，置锅内用文火微炒，取出，放凉。(每银柴胡100斤，用活鳖200个取血)"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-mne46ky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-mne46ky","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘；性微寒"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-qi617xj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-qi617xj","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肝；胃经"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-j3lunzl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-j3lunzl","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】清虚热；除疳热。主阴虚发热；骨蒸劳热；小儿疳积发热"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-xwmit9b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-xwmit9b","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，5-9g；或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-1m7lpo9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-1m7lpo9","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】外感风寒及血虚无热者忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-e8l5nps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-e8l5nps","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】①治骨蒸劳热：铝柴胡一钱五分，胡黄连、秦艽、鳖甲(醋炙)、地骨皮、青蒿。知母各一钱，甘草五分。水二钟，煎八分，食远服。(《证治准绳》清骨散)②治温证潮热，身体枯瘦，皮肤甲错，消索而不润泽者：银柴胡二钱，鳖甲三钱。(《温症指归》银甲散)；清胃散《证治准绳》；银甲散《温症指归》"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-jr11fy5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-jr11fy5","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-lig10o4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-lig10o4","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《本经逢原》：银柴胡，其性味与石斛不甚相远。不独清热，兼能凉血。《和剂局方》治上下诸血龙脑鸡苏丸中用之。凡人虚劳方中，惟银州者为宜，若用北柴胡，升动虚阳、发热喘嗽，愈无宁字，可不辨而混用乎、按柴胡条下，《本经》推陈致新，明目益精，皆指银夏者而言。非北柴胡所能也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-3ixuof0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-3ixuof0","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草便读》：银柴胡，无解表之性。从来注《本草》者，皆言其能治小儿府热，大人痨热，大抵有入肝胆凉血之功。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-n961hbp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-n961hbp","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草正义》：柴胡，古以银州产者为胜。宋之苏颂己有是说，陈承亦谓银夏者最良，然虽有其说，而尚未分用，故濒湖《纲目》仍未显为区别。今之二种分用者，盖即石顽提倡主力。而以今之功用言之，治虚热骨蒸，自有实效，断非北柴胡之升阳泄汗可比；然则古人谓柴胡为虚劳之药者，亦捐银柴胡言之也，赵恕轩《纲目拾遗》，谓热在骨髓，非银柴胡莫疗，用以治虚劳肌热骨蒸，劳疟热从髓出及小儿五疳赢热，盖退热而不苦泄，理阴而不升腾，固虚热之良药。苟劳怯而未至血液枯绝，以此清理虚火之烙的，再合之育阴补脾，尚可徐图挽救，非北柴胡之发泄者所可同日语也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-3fyaeib","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-3fyaeib","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草经疏》：治劳热骨蒸。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-f9jgfvm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-f9jgfvm","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本草备要》：治疳良。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-45v8jm9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-45v8jm9","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《本草从新》：治虚劳肌热骨蒸，劳疟热从髓出，小儿五疳赢热。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-3m1rmwa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-3m1rmwa","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《医林纂要》：坚肾水，乎相火。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-3h47s28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-3h47s28","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《本草求原》：清肺、胃、脾、肾热，兼能凉血。洽五脏虚损，肌肤劳热，骨蒸烦痛；湿痹拘挛。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-rr8eqqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-rr8eqqb","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《新疆中草药手册》：清热凉血。洽肺结核潮热。"}]},{"ID":"20240902180006-9jdy8dc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180006-9jdy8dc","updated":"20240902180015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902180008-f5gwrd7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902180008-f5gwrd7","updated":"20240902180015"}},{"ID":"20240902180009-t3n5ln7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902180009-t3n5ln7","updated":"20240902180015"}}]}